## Ideas re-implemented (credited; no code was copied)

- earendil-works/absurd (commit 3cfc64f): the task, run and checkpoint state machine, claims with
  leases, first-write-wins checkpoints and events, re-implemented on SQLite in `packages/core`.
- earendil-works/pi, packages/durable (commit fdce48e): intent recorded before each effect with
  replay policies, crash-loop parking, request dedupe, and the shape of a storage conformance kit.
- morluto/rea (commit b4938ae): the evidence and residual-unknown model, effect classes, and the
  observed, derived and inferred confidence classes.
- pingdotgg/t3code (commit 7e289ae1): delegated sign-in through each provider's official client in
  a separate configuration home per account; pairing, signed sessions and short-lived WebSocket
  tickets; the untrusted-content envelope.
- stablyai/orca (as above): one worker per task with its own git worktree, retry receipts, the
  coordinator mailbox, the circuit breaker and the liveness vocabulary.
